rnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2019 Q4","e":"stn","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Theresa Jang","x":"This was largely due to a 7.8% increase in net revenue improved gross margins and lower admin and marketing expenses driven by our cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/27/stantec-inc-stn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q1","e":"stn","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Theresa Jang","x":"This was largely due to a 5.7% increase in net revenue and lower administrative and marketing expenses driven by our cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/stantec-inc-stn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q1","e":"stn","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gord Johnston","x":"So we gave people options, such as rather than having to move to a layoff or a furlough situation, we'd look at things like a reduction in hours or a work sharing, or if people wanted to use up some of the bank's time that they had in jurisdictions where we're allowed to bank time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/stantec-inc-stn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q1","e":"stn","d":"2020-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Theresa Jang","x":"Given the unprecedented uncertainty facing the global economy and our inability to provide a reliable forecast of net revenues for the second half of 2020, we are withdrawing our guidance for the balance of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/stantec-inc-stn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q1","e":"stn","d":"2020-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gord Johnston","x":"So I think that's one of the reasons why we really thought that we wanted to withdraw guidance, just because there's -- until we have a little bit more certainty, it's really difficult for us to speculate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/stantec-inc-stn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q2","e":"stn","d":"2020-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gordon Allan Johnston","x":"Through our reshaping efforts in 2019, ongoing cost reduction initiatives and significant reduction in discretionary spending there during the pandemic, we've been successful in protecting our industry-leading adjusted EBITDA margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/stantec-inc-stn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q2","e":"stn","d":"2020-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gordon Allan Johnston","x":"Given the unprecedented circumstances brought on by the pandemic, we withdrew our 2020 guidance in May.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/stantec-inc-stn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q3","e":"stn","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gord Johnston","x":"Our reshaping efforts in 2019, ongoing cost-reduction initiatives and a significant reduction in discretionary spending during the pandemic continue to protect our industry-leading adjusted EBITDA margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/stantec-inc-stn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q3","e":"stn","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gord Johnston","x":"So I don't see the need for any more significant headcount reductions because it's going to run very well throughout the pandemic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/stantec-inc-stn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q3","e":"stn","d":"2020-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Theresa Jang","x":"As the result of the uncertainty created by the pandemic, we withdrew our 2020 guidance in May.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/stantec-inc-stn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q3","e":"stn","d":"2020-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Theresa Jang","x":"Today, we're reiterating our outlook for 2020 as set out in August.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/stantec-inc-stn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q4","e":"stn","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Theresa Jang","x":"The main driver is the cost savings will give from reduced occupancy costs, which as Gord mentioned, will add approximately $0.10 per share to 2021 EPS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/stantec-inc-stn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2020 Q4","e":"stn","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gord Johnston","x":"And then they've sort of come down to more normal type seasonally adjusted levels, but what we really try to do, in addition, was to not go too far from a headcount reduction perspective because we see that the work is there as you can see from our growth in our backlog.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/stantec-inc-stn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2021 Q1","e":"stn","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gord Johnston","x":"Today, we reaffirmed our guidance and targets for 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/stantec-inc-stn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2021 Q3","e":"stn","d":"2021-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Frederic Bastien","x":"Thanks Gord. pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/stantec-inc-stn-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2021 Q3","e":"stn","d":"2021-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Benoit Poirier","x":"And with respect to the overall labor shortage, wage increase, could you maybe provide some color on how it impacts organic growth, whether it will provide -- how much of the boost it could provide on organic growth going forward as you pass-through those price increase to customers?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/stantec-inc-stn-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2021 Q3","e":"stn","d":"2021-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Benoit Poirier","x":"Just to come back on the organic growth for the full year, still maintaining the guidance, although you commented about the expectation for Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/stantec-inc-stn-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"STN 2026 Q2","e":"stn","d":"2026-08-13","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Gordon Johnston","x":"With our strong margins year-to-date and continued focus on operational excellence, we are increasing our outlook for adjusted EBITDA margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/19/stantec-stn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[31,1,7448,0,0,0,5690,1093],[39,1,7657,0,0,0,5349,1742],[40,1,7186,0,0,0,5385,1431],[41,1,5764,0,0,0,4590,822],[42,1,7224,0,0,0,5733,1047],[43,1,10479,0,0,0,8384,1605],[44,1,10309,0,0,0,8090,1707],[45,1,7478,0,0,0,5468,1532],[46,1,9435,0,0,0,6914,1906],[47,1,8592,0,0,0,6228,1861],[66,1,7871,0,0,0,2211,5179],[67,1,8865,0,0,0,2413,5864]],"cinema":[[31,1,7448,0,0,0,5690,1093],[39,1,7657,0,0,0,5349,1742],[40,1,7186,0,0,0,5385,1431],[41,1,5764,0,0,0,4590,822],[42,1,7224,0,0,0,5733,1047],[43,1,10479,0,0,0,8384,1605],[44,1,10309,0,0,0,8090,1707],[45,1,7478,0,0,0,5468,1532],[46,1,9435,0,0,0,6914,1906],[47,1,8592,0,0,0,6228,1861],[66,1,7871,0,0,0,2211,5179],[67,1,8865,0,0,0,2413,5864]],"imax":[[31,1,7448,0,0,0,5690,1093],[39,1,7657,0,0,0,5349,1742],[40,1,7186,0,0,0,5385,1431],[41,1,5764,0,0,0,4590,822],[42,1,7224,0,0,0,5733,1047],[43,1,10479,0,0,0,8384,1605],[44,1,10309,0,0,0,8090,1707],[45,1,7478,0,0,0,5468,1532],[46,1,9435,0,0,0,6914,1906],[47,1,8592,0,0,0,6228,1861],[66,1,7871,0,0,0,2211